{"id":"reference/Variables","kind":"langref","title":"变量","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Variables","file":"reference/Variables.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Variables","text":"变量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Namespace-Level-Variables","text":"命名空间级变量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Locally-Scoped-Global-Variables","text":"局部作用域中的全局变量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Thread-Local-Variables","text":"线程局部变量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Local-Variables","text":"局部变量"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Variables\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Variables\">变量</a></h2>\n\n      <p>变量是<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Memory/#Memory\">内存</a>存储的一个单元。</p>\n      <p>声明变量时通常优先使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span></code> 而非 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span></code>。这会减少人和计算机阅读代码时需要处理的信息，并创造更多优化机会。</p>\n      <p>变量绝不允许遮蔽外层作用域的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Identifiers/#Identifiers\">标识符</a>。</p>\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span></code> 关键字或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#extern\">@extern</a> 内置函数，可以链接另一个目标文件导出的变量。使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span></code> 关键字或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#export\">@export</a> 内置函数，可以让其他目标文件在链接时访问变量。两种情况下，变量类型都必须兼容 C ABI。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/C/#Exporting-a-C-Library\">导出 C 库</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n      <h3 id=\"Namespace-Level-Variables\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Namespace-Level-Variables\">命名空间级变量</a></h3>\n\n      <p><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Namespace/#Namespace\">命名空间</a>级变量具有全局生命周期，与声明顺序无关，并且按需求进行语义分析。它们的初始值隐式在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>求值。如果命名空间级变量为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span></code>，则其值在 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span></code> 已知，否则在运行时已知。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_namespace_level_variables.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> y: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = add(<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>, x);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = add(<span class=\"tok-number\">12</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">34</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"container level variables\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">46</span>, x);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">56</span>, y);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">add</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a + b;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_namespace_level_variables.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_namespace_level_variables.test.container level variables...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <p>命名空间级变量可以在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#struct\">struct</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#union\">union</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">enum</a> 或 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/opaque/#opaque\">opaque</a> 内声明：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_namespaced_variable.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"namespaced container level variable\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1235</span>, foo());\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1236</span>, foo());\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> S = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    S.x += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> S.x;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_namespaced_variable.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_namespaced_variable.test.namespaced container level variable...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Locally-Scoped-Global-Variables\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Locally-Scoped-Global-Variables\">局部作用域中的全局变量</a></h3>\n\n      <p>在函数内部使用<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Namespace/#Namespace\">命名空间</a>，也可以创建具有全局生命周期的局部变量。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_locally_scoped_global_variable.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"static local variable\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1235</span>, foo());\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1236</span>, foo());\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> S = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n    };\n    S.x += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> S.x;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_locally_scoped_global_variable.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_locally_scoped_global_variable.test.static local variable...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Thread-Local-Variables\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Thread-Local-Variables\">线程局部变量</a></h3>\n\n      <p>可以使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">threadlocal</span></code> 关键字将变量指定为线程局部变量，使每个线程使用该变量的独立实例：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_thread_local_variables.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> assert = std.debug.assert;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">threadlocal</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"thread local storage\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> thread1 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.Thread.spawn(.{}, testTls, .{});\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> thread2 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.Thread.spawn(.{}, testTls, .{});\n    testTls();\n    thread1.join();\n    thread2.join();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">testTls</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    assert(x == <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>);\n    x += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    assert(x == <span class=\"tok-number\">1235</span>);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_thread_local_variables.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_thread_local_variables.test.thread local storage...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <p>在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Single-Threaded-Builds/#Single-Threaded-Builds\">单线程构建</a>中，所有线程局部变量均视为普通的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Namespace-Level-Variables\">命名空间级变量</a>。</p>\n      <p>线程局部变量不能是 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span></code>。</p>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Local-Variables\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Local-Variables\">局部变量</a></h3>\n\n      <p>局部变量出现在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Functions\">函数</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">comptime</a> 块及带标签的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Blocks/#Blocks\">块</a>内。</p>\n      <p>局部变量为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span></code> 时，表示初始化后其值不再改变。如果 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span></code> 变量的初始值在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知，则变量本身也在 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span></code> 已知。</p>\n      <p>局部变量可以使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span></code> 关键字限定。这样其值将在 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span></code> 已知，且所有读取和写入都发生在程序的语义分析期间，而非运行时。<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span></code> 表达式中声明的所有变量隐式为 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span></code> 变量。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_comptime_variables.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"comptime vars\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> y: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n\n    x += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    y += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, x);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, y);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (y != <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此编译错误永远不会触发，因为 y 是 comptime 变量，</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 因而 `y != 2` 是编译时值，此 if 会静态求值。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@compileError</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"wrong y value\"</span>);\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_comptime_variables.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_comptime_variables.test.comptime vars...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":27,"translated":27}}
